{
  "path": "/work/brown-boys-motor-club/seo-growth",
  "title": "Brown Boys Motor Club | SEO Growth | Fyntix",
  "description": "A six-month local SEO case study: Brown Boys Motor Club grew from 375 to 2,290 organic clicks, with 142,000 impressions and better search positions.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
  "sections": [
    {
      "tag": "article",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "contents"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-hero\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto pb-20 max-md:pb-10 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding \" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\"><div class=\"bb-wrap\">\n<div class=\"bb-meta\"><a href=\"/work\">Our work</a><span>Automotive · Local &amp; technical SEO</span></div>\n<h1 class=\"bb-hero-heading\"><span class=\"bb-client\">Brown Boys Motor Club</span><span>More discovery.<br>Stronger <em>local search.</em></span></h1>\n<p class=\"bb-hero-intro\">A six-month search programme for an Oshawa dealership, connecting technical improvements, local relevance and useful buying information.</p>\n<nav class=\"bb-navigation\" aria-label=\"Case study sections\"><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-overview\">Results overview</a><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-brief\">The brief</a><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-approach\">The approach</a><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-results\">Performance detail</a><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-interpretation\">What changed</a><a href=\"#brown-boys-motor-club-reporting\">Reporting</a></nav>\n</div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-overview\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bw-dashboard bb-overview\">\n<div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Six months. A much bigger search presence.</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Google Search Console · consecutive six-month windows</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bw-dashboard-replay\" data-bw-replay hidden>Replay results</button></div>\n<div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\">\n<article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bb-clicks-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Organic search clicks</h3><p class=\"bb-main-number\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+510%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"510\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">510</span>%</span></p><p class=\"bb-card-intro\">More opportunities to discover the dealership.</p><div class=\"bb-columns\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Organic clicks increased from 375 to 2,290; column scale zero to 2,500\"><div class=\"bb-column\"><div class=\"bb-column-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-column-bar \" style=\"--bb-height:15.0%\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\"></div></div><p class=\"bb-column-number\">375</p><p class=\"bb-column-label\">Previous six months</p></div><div class=\"bb-column\"><div class=\"bb-column-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-column-bar bb-column-bar--current\" style=\"--bb-height:91.60000000000001%\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\"></div></div><p class=\"bb-column-number\">2,290</p><p class=\"bb-column-label\">Following six months</p></div></div><p class=\"bb-note\">375 to 2,290 clicks · zero-based scale, 0–2,500.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bb-impressions-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Search impressions</h3><p class=\"bb-stat-number\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">142,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"142000\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">142,000</span></span></p><p class=\"bb-card-intro\">Up from 4,360 appearances in search.</p><div class=\"bb-small-comparison\"><span>32.6×</span><p>the previous visibility</p></div><p class=\"bb-note\">An impression records a search appearance, rather than a visit.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bb-position-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Average search position</h3><p class=\"bb-stat-number\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">7.5</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"7.5\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">7.5</span></span></p><p class=\"bb-card-intro\">Improved from 13.5.</p><div class=\"bb-position-summary\"><span>6 positions</span><p>closer to the top, on average</p></div><p class=\"bb-note\">Search-wide average · lower is better.</p></article>\n</div><p class=\"bb-dashboard-note\">Reported click uplift: +510%. Multiples and chart geometry use the displayed, rounded totals. Organic search results; no paid advertising was used for this programme.</p></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-brief\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap bb-brief-grid\"><div>\n<p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">The brief</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">Help local car buyers<br>find their next option.</h2>\n<div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Brown Boys Motor Club buys, sells, trades and finances pre-owned vehicles in Oshawa, Ontario. Its search programme focused on local discovery across the surrounding Durham Region.</p><p>A vehicle search can begin in several places: a preferred model, a nearby dealer or a question about financing. Each starting point needs a useful answer and a clear next step. A dealership’s website can connect those needs to the relevant inventory and service information.</p><p>The commercial objective is a better route from a search to an informed enquiry. This case measures the discovery stage of that journey: how frequently the website appeared, how often people clicked and where its results appeared on average.</p></div>\n<dl class=\"bb-facts\"><div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Brown Boys Motor Club</dd></div><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Oshawa, Ontario, Canada</dd></div><div><dt>Engagement</dt><dd>Six-month SEO programme</dd></div><div><dt>Measurement</dt><dd>Google Search Console</dd></div></dl></div>\n<figure class=\"bb-photo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/dealership-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"A red Audi featured on Brown Boys Motor Club’s website\" width=\"1650\" height=\"1650\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"bb-photo-logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/brown-boys-logo.webp\" alt=\"Brown Boys Motor Club\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1491\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></figure></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-challenge\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap bb-editorial\"><div><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">The challenge</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">A local business.<br>A narrow search footprint.</h2></div>\n<div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>The starting audit identified slow mobile pages, weak page structure, limited location targeting and an incomplete Google Business Profile. Inventory content and internal links also needed attention.</p><p>For a dealership, those issues touch the same customer journey. Someone arriving on a phone needs to understand the vehicle, find relevant information and continue exploring without unnecessary friction. A city page should make the business’s local offer clear, while an inventory page should explain the individual vehicle.</p><p>The starting figures provided a practical benchmark. With 375 clicks over the earlier six-month window, the site had room to reach a wider audience. The average position of 13.5 also pointed to an opportunity to improve visibility across the overall query mix.</p></div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-approach\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap\"><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">The approach</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">Make every part of discovery<br>work together.</h2><div class=\"bb-approach-grid\"><article class=\"bb-approach-card\"><p class=\"bb-phase\">Month 1</p><h3>Strengthen the foundation</h3><div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Mobile image optimisation, crawl fixes, sitemap submission, canonical checks and structured data addressed the technical base.</p><p>This stage gives the rest of the programme a usable foundation. Clear page relationships help people explore the site, while consistent technical signals make the intended pages easier to discover.</p></div></article><article class=\"bb-approach-card\"><p class=\"bb-phase\">Months 1–2</p><h3>Connect pages with intent</h3><div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Location-aware titles, headings, inventory descriptions, internal links and FAQs sharpened page relevance.</p><p>A page has a clearer purpose when its topic matches the question that brought someone there. Useful vehicle details and a logical route to related inventory can support the next step in that decision.</p></div></article><article class=\"bb-approach-card\"><p class=\"bb-phase\">Months 2–3</p><h3>Build local consistency</h3><div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Business Profile improvements, customer-review follow-up and consistent Canadian directory listings supported local presence.</p><p>People compare businesses across several surfaces. Consistent business information makes that comparison simpler and reduces uncertainty about which dealership they are looking at.</p></div></article><article class=\"bb-approach-card\"><p class=\"bb-phase\">Months 3–6</p><h3>Answer buying questions</h3><div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Local landing pages and Ontario buying guides extended the site’s coverage of relevant searches.</p><p>Educational information can help a visitor evaluate an option before making contact. The useful connection is between the question, a relevant answer and the part of the business that can help.</p></div></article></div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-results\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bw-dashboard\"><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">Performance, in detail</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">See what moved.<br>Understand what it means.</h2><p class=\"bb-intro\">Each chart compares the previous six months with the following six months. The same scale is used for both periods within each chart.</p><div class=\"bb-results-grid\">\n<article class=\"bb-report-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Organic clicks</h3><p class=\"bb-chart-period\">Six-month totals · common scale 0–2,500</p><div class=\"bb-bars\"><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Previous six months</span><strong>375</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar \" style=\"--bb-width:15.000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Following six months</span><strong>2,290</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar bb-bar--current\" style=\"--bb-width:91.600000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bb-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0</span><span>2,500</span></div><p class=\"bb-chart-result\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+1,915</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"1915\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">1,915</span></span> additional clicks</p><p class=\"bb-note\">2,290 − 375 = 1,915 more recorded search clicks.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bb-report-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Search impressions</h3><p class=\"bb-chart-period\">Six-month totals · common scale 0–150,000</p><div class=\"bb-bars\"><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Previous six months</span><strong>4,360</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar \" style=\"--bb-width:2.906667%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Following six months</span><strong>142,000</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar bb-bar--current\" style=\"--bb-width:94.666667%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bb-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0</span><span>150,000</span></div><p class=\"bb-chart-result\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+137,640</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"137640\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">137,640</span></span> appearances</p><p class=\"bb-note\">About 32.6 times the earlier total, or a reported 3,157% increase.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bb-report-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>A stronger average position</h3><p class=\"bb-chart-period\">Position 1–20 · lower is better</p><svg class=\"bb-rank-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 150\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"bb-rank-title bb-rank-desc\"><title id=\"bb-rank-title\">Average position improved from 13.5 to 7.5</title><desc id=\"bb-rank-desc\">A shared position scale from 1 to 20, with lower positions toward the left.</desc><line class=\"bb-rank-track\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"72\"/><line class=\"bb-rank-gain\" x1=\"214.74\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"385.26\" y2=\"72\"/><circle class=\"bb-rank-before\" cx=\"385.26\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\"/><circle class=\"bb-rank-after\" cx=\"214.74\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\"/><text x=\"385.26\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13.5 before</text><text x=\"214.74\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7.5 after</text><text class=\"bb-rank-tick\" x=\"30\" y=\"145\">1</text><text class=\"bb-rank-tick\" x=\"570\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text></svg><p class=\"bb-chart-result\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">6</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"6\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">6</span></span> positions of improvement</p><p class=\"bb-note\">An average across searches; this does not mean every keyword ranked at 7.5.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bb-report-card\" data-bw-animate><h3>Click-through rate</h3><p class=\"bb-chart-period\">Share of impressions resulting in clicks · scale 0–10%</p><div class=\"bb-bars\"><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Previous six months</span><strong>8.6%</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar \" style=\"--bb-width:86.000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div><div><div class=\"bb-bar-label\"><span>Following six months</span><strong>1.6%</strong></div><div class=\"bb-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bb-bar bb-bar--current\" style=\"--bb-width:16.000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bb-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0</span><span>10%</span></div><p class=\"bb-chart-result\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">7 percentage points</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"7\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">7</span> percentage points</span> lower</p><p class=\"bb-note\">The overall rate fell while the number of clicks grew. Both are part of the result.</p></article>\n<article class=\"bb-report-card bb-report-card--wide\" data-bw-animate><div class=\"bb-editorial\"><div><h3>What makes up the final click total?</h3><p class=\"bb-chart-period\">An arithmetic breakdown of the two reporting windows.</p><div class=\"bb-stack\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"2,290 total clicks equals the earlier total of 375 plus an increase of 1,915\"><div class=\"bb-stack-before\" style=\"--bb-width:16.375546%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div><div class=\"bb-stack-gain\" style=\"--bb-width:83.624454%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\"></div></div><div class=\"bb-stack-legend\"><p><span class=\"bb-key bb-key--before\"></span>375 earlier clicks</p><p><span class=\"bb-key bb-key--gain\"></span>1,915 additional clicks</p></div></div><div><p class=\"bb-analysis-number\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">6.1×</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"6.1\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">6.1</span>×</span></p><p class=\"bb-card-intro\">as many organic clicks in the later window</p><p class=\"bb-note\">The added portion is 83.6% of the final total. It describes the difference between periods, rather than a separately tracked audience segment.</p></div></div></article>\n</div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-interpretation\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap bb-editorial\"><div><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">Reading the result</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">More clicks.<br>A lower rate.<br><em>Both can be true.</em></h2></div>\n<div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>Click-through rate is a ratio: clicks divided by impressions. A much larger denominator can reduce that ratio even when the numerator grows. Here, impressions expanded faster than clicks, so the lower aggregate CTR is consistent with a much broader search footprint.</p><p>The figures make that relationship visible. The earlier period combined 375 clicks with 4,360 impressions, approximately 8.6%. The later period combined 2,290 clicks with 142,000 impressions, approximately 1.6%. The rounded rates describe two very different levels of exposure.</p><p>That does not make every new impression equally valuable. A useful follow-up is to separate branded and non-branded queries, review important landing pages and compare mobile performance. That would show where additional visibility is translating into relevant visits and where titles, content or rankings still need work.</p><p>The strongest supported conclusion is greater discovery through organic search. Enquiries, test drives and vehicle sales would require their own tracking before those outcomes could be attached to this campaign.</p></div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-priorities\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap\"><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">What we would measure next</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">Turn stronger discovery<br>into a clearer business picture.</h2><p class=\"bb-intro\">The next stage is a measurement plan, rather than an additional set of claimed results.</p><div class=\"bb-next-grid\"><article class=\"bb-next-card\"><h3>Prioritise useful visits</h3><p>Review which search terms and landing pages are attracting prospective buyers. Rising exposure is most useful when the page answers the intent behind the visit.</p></article><article class=\"bb-next-card\"><h3>Connect discovery to enquiries</h3><p>Measure calls, finance-form completions and test-drive requests as distinct actions. Keep duplicate events and completed sales separate so the report reflects the customer journey.</p></article><article class=\"bb-next-card\"><h3>Keep inventory journeys current</h3><p>Review the experience when a vehicle sells or a listing changes. Help visitors continue to relevant available options and keep the site’s navigation useful.</p></article></div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-reporting\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap\"><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">A report you can read</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">The numbers, with their context.</h2>\n<div class=\"bb-table-scroll\"><table class=\"bb-table\"><caption>Google Search Console · two consecutive six-month windows</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Measure</th><th scope=\"col\">Previous six months</th><th scope=\"col\">Following six months</th><th scope=\"col\">Change</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Organic clicks</th><td>375</td><td>2,290</td><td>+510% reported</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Search impressions</th><td>4,360</td><td>142,000</td><td>+3,157% reported</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Average position</th><td>13.5</td><td>7.5</td><td>6 positions better</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Average CTR</th><td>8.6%</td><td>1.6%</td><td>−7 percentage points</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"bb-reporting-copy\"><div class=\"bb-prose\"><p>These are aggregate organic search comparisons. The report gives the duration of each window without calendar start and end dates. The charts therefore compare two six-month totals rather than presenting an invented monthly trend.</p><p>The larger totals in the report are rounded. Derived differences and multiples here use those displayed figures. Clicks are search-result interactions, impressions are appearances and position is an average; they describe different parts of discovery.</p></div></div>\n<details class=\"bb-evidence\"><summary>View the Search Console comparison</summary><figure><a href=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/search-console-comparison.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/search-console-comparison.jpg\" alt=\"Search Console comparison: 2.29K versus 375 clicks; 142K versus 4.36K impressions; 1.6% versus 8.6% CTR; average position 7.5 versus 13.5\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Campaign report showing the two six-month windows. Open the image for a closer look.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<div class=\"bb-cta\"><p class=\"bb-eyebrow\">Your next stage of growth</p><h2 class=\"bb-title\">Make it easier for the right customers<br>to <em>find you.</em></h2><p>Talk with Fyntix about search visibility, local relevance and a measurement plan connected to your business.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full\">Book a free strategy call</a></div>\n</div></section></div>"
    },
