      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"brown-boys-motor-club-next-up\" class=\"bb-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10 \"><div class=\"bb-wrap\"><h2 class=\"bb-title\">More work</h2><div class=\"bb-next-work\"><div class=\"w-full pointer-events-auto\"><a href=\"/work/property-management-toronto/seo-growth\" class=\"case-study-item__link clickable-block block w-full no-underline text-inherit\"><div id=\"work-property-management-toronto\" class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8 scroll-mt-72\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail pmt-thumbnail relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-21-19 bg-charcoal\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Property Management Toronto: 124% more booked consultations and 47% more organic search clicks\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/property-management-toronto/toronto-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"1120\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full rounded-2xl object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__shade\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__logo pmt-thumbnail__logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/property-management-toronto/pmt-logo-rgb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"782\" height=\"237\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__results\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__metric\">124% more consultations</p><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__value\">47% more organic search clicks</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-normal text-2xl text-spark tracking-tight\">Property Management Toronto</p><h3 class=\"font-normal text-3xl tracking-tight text-haze-900\">Local search. More booked consultations.</h3></div><p class=\"font-normal text-haze-60 tracking-tight text-lg\">Technical SEO, local content and a clearer path from search to enquiry.</p></div></div></a></div><div class=\"w-full pointer-events-auto\"><a href=\"/work/spartan-plumbing/google-ads-growth\" class=\"case-study-item__link clickable-block block w-full no-underline text-inherit\"><div id=\"work-spartan-plumbing\" class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8 scroll-mt-72\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail spartan-thumbnail relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-21-19 bg-charcoal\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Spartan Plumbing: $506k company revenue, $33.7k Google Ads spend\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/spartan-plumbing/plumber-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1260\" height=\"1140\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full rounded-2xl object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__shade\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__logo spartan-thumbnail__logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/spartan-plumbing/spartan-logo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"561\" height=\"212\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__results\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__metric\">$506k company revenue</p><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__value\">$33.7k Google Ads spend</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-normal text-2xl text-spark tracking-tight\">Spartan Plumbing</p><h3 class=\"font-normal text-3xl tracking-tight text-haze-900\">Search ads. Real jobs.</h3></div><p class=\"font-normal text-haze-60 tracking-tight text-lg\">A focused Google Search programme, with a detailed view of business growth.</p></div></div></a></div></div></div></section></div>"
